  talentName: Death's Dance
  autoDescription: 1
  description: 40% (Max 48%) of all damage you take is stored instead of hitting
    your HP. If the stored damage ever reaches your current HP, you fall at once.
    Each evade removes 30% of the stored damage; each of your attacks that hits removes
    10%, and a critical hit removes another 15%.
  storeRate: 0.4
  maxStoreRate: 48
  evadeClear: 0.3
  attackClear: 0.1
  critClear: 0.15
